Tests of the logic of the Storage page (commander/js/storage.js) and of more
arrays in the same daemon (commander/js/arrays.js).

They need only Node.js 18 or later, no browser and no dependencies:

    node --test test/ui/storage.test.mjs test/ui/arrays.test.mjs

What needs real disks is tested by tests/api-test.sh and tests/multi-array-test.sh of the lab, inside its
container: https://github.com/paleka/snapraid-lab
